## 01 Context · Data Requirements

**Required sources, and exclusions**

Customer feedback portal from Aha!, Client meeting feedback summaries from Google Docs, Jira bugs trends, Current Jira feedback, Company Product Strategy document. Exclude any internal discussions unrelated to customer feedback.

**How fresh must it be**

The data needs to be checked every 24 hours. Changes must be made to suggestions only when the recommendations made previously are changing. However, I want the data updates to be done every 24 hours so the latest information is accessible at anytime.

## 02 Tools · System Capabilities

**The verb list**

Juno must be able to retrieve and read customer feedback from Aha!, Jira, Slack, and Google Meet. It must identify themes, patterns from all these sources and use the product strategy document in Google Doc to create development features, prioritize the backlog on the PM board in Jira.

**Deliberate omissions**

Juno will not be allowed to modify existing Jira tickets or  non-customer feedback related conversations. Changes to existing Jira tickets that are needed will be specified in a new google doc that the PM can review and take the next steps.

## 03 Loop · AI Costs & Latency

**Turn ceiling and escalation**

Juno must try  synthesize the feedback from all the sources listed above and if any tool is not working, atleast 2 attempts need to be made to fetch the information. If any source is still not reachable, then an email alert needs to be created.

